havannes, a French painter described by Vincent van Gogh as \"the master of all of us\".","The Sacred Grove, Beloved of the Arts and Muses"],"56377683":["The Sweet Landscape is an oil on canvas painting by the French painter Pierre Puvis de Chavannes, created in 1882. It is held at the Musée Bonnat, in Bayonne.","The Sweet Landscape"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}